Details.description:
This is the full detail to send over and format in this way: 

{"title":"Book an Appointment","subtitle":"Choose a date and time that works for you.","confirmLabel":"Confirm Booking","availableDates":[{"date":"2026-05-27","slots":["9:00 AM","10:00 AM","11:30 AM","2:00 PM","3:30 PM"]},{"date":"2026-05-28","slots":["8:30 AM","10:30 AM","1:00 PM","4:00 PM"]},{"date":"2026-05-29","slots":["9:00 AM","11:00 AM","2:30 PM"]},{"date":"2026-05-31","slots":["10:00 AM","12:00 PM","3:00 PM","4:30 PM"]},{"date":"2026-06-01","slots":["9:30 AM","11:30 AM","1:30 PM"]},{"date":"2026-06-02","slots":["8:00 AM","10:00 AM","2:00 PM","3:30 PM","5:00 PM"]}]}

Rules: 'title' is the heading shown at the top of the calendar (string, required). 'subtitle' is a short descriptive line below the title (string, required). 'confirmLabel' is the text on the confirmation button (string, required). 'availableDates' is an array of objects each with a 'date' field in YYYY-MM-DD format and a 'slots' array of time strings in 12-hour format (e.g. '9:00 AM'). Only dates listed in availableDates will appear as selectable on the calendar. Provide at least one date with at least one slot. Do not wrap the payload in a 'value' key.
